/*                                                                   */
/* Program Narrative - Build and seed the dev price table the        */
/*                     TIMPAY002X stub answers item prices from,     */
/*                     standing in for the OE0337R price module      */
/*                     while its registration is tied out.  Seed a   */
/*                     price for every item the blank-plan test      */
/*                     will use; one under $99.00 proves the skip.   */
/*                                                                   */
/* Author            - G Chau                                        */
/*                     Littleton Coin Company                        */
/*                     Littleton NH                                  */
/*                                                                   */
/* Date Written      - 09/03/2026                                    */
/* Run Instructions  - ACS Run SQL Scripts, or RUNSQLSTM             */
/*                     SRCFILE(LSCDEVLIBP/QSQLSRC)                   */
/*                     SRCMBR(TPPRICEDV)                             */
/*********************************************************************/
